{"title": "Tides of Chaos", "pageid": 17206, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the reaction to trigger Tides of Chaos after a roll is made. For the toggleable passive to use it before a roll, see <a href=\"/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tides of Chaos (passive feature)\">Tides of Chaos (passive feature)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tides_of_Chaos.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Tides_of_Chaos.webp/300px-Tides_of_Chaos.webp, /w/images/7/7f/Tides_of_Chaos.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Tides_of_Chaos.webp/300px-Tides_of_Chaos.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Tides_of_Chaos.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Tides of Chaos</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(sorcerer_subclass)\" title=\"Wild Magic (sorcerer subclass)\">Wild Magic</a> sorcerer <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction_(Combat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction (Combat)\">reaction</a> that rerolls a failed attack roll, saving throw, or skill check, provided it was not already rolled with advantage. After this feature is triggered, the next spell cast has a greatly increased chance of a creating a Wild Magic surge (50% chance instead of the normal 5%).\n<p>Alternatively, this feature can be used via the corresponding <a href=\"/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tides of Chaos (passive feature)\">toggleable passive</a> before a roll is made.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nGain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Check</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. Increased chance of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a> surge afterwards.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png/25px-Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png/38px-Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png/25px-Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tides of Chaos Charge</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_TidesOfChaos</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_TidesOfChaos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_TidesOfChaos\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Tides_of_Chaos\"> Condition: Tides of Chaos </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(Condition)\" title=\"Tides of Chaos (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tides of Chaos\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(Condition)\" title=\"Tides of Chaos (Condition)\">Tides of Chaos</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Increased chance of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a> surge (to 50%).</li>\n<li>Lost immediately after casting a Level 1 or higher Spell and rolling a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a> Check.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_Sorcerer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wild Magic Sorcerer\">Wild Magic Sorcerer</a></li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Wild Magic Sorcerers receive 1 <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png/30px-Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png/40px-Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/Tides_of_Chaos_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tides of Chaos Charge</a> which is replenished on every <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</li>\n<li>Normally, a D20 is rolled each time a leveled spell is cast. If the result is 20, a Surge is triggered. Tides of Chaos reduces the <a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a> to 11 (i.e. a 50% chance).</li>\n<li>Although it is triggered as a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction_(Combat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction (Combat)\">reaction</a>, it does not consume a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> resource.</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Feywild_Sparks\" title=\"Ring of Feywild Sparks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Feywild_Sparks\" title=\"Ring of Feywild Sparks\">Ring of Feywild Sparks</a> makes the chance for the wild magic surge 100%.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Tides of Chaos grants a <a href=\"/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tides of Chaos (passive feature)\">toggleable passive</a> by the same name which, when toggled on, provides Advantage on the character's next Ability Check. Due to the way this passive is granted, it defaults to \"off\" and cannot be toggled \"on\" the very first time it is acquired until <i>after</i> the character has first made an ability check, has had a condition applied to it, has used a short rest, or has taken a long rest.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035035\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.092 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3199/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40170/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21488/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1436938/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n101.75%   79.059     39 Template:Trim\n100.00%   77.698      1 -total\n 99.26%   77.120      1 Template:Feature_page\n 13.77%   10.697      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 13.76%   10.690      6 Template:Icon_text\n 12.97%   10.076      1 Template:Condition\n 10.57%    8.213      1 Template:SmPass\n 10.55%    8.199      1 Template:Resource\n  9.40%    7.307      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  9.38%    7.288      3 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:17206-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715035035 and revision id 382108. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}